{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before humanity existed, Earth was ruled by the Existentials: colossal conscious beings capable of shaping reality. They created lesser races to serve them, but not all accepted that fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some chose to rebel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bereshipsis</strong> is a turn-based tactical roguelike where you lead a team of rebellious Existentials determined to defy their creators and prevent the end of the world. Choose wisely, act strategically, and face a collapsing future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/5b38d1800d0609d67efad9da42c3ad9e.poster.avif?t=1767087475\" width=616 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/5b38d1800d0609d67efad9da42c3ad9e.webm?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/5b38d1800d0609d67efad9da42c3ad9e.mp4?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Move your team across a hexagonal board. Push enemies across the map, turn invisible, upgrade your attacks and skills, teleport, and even control your enemies if you wish!</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/7430e1b568c9d535dda7745707de0fe7.poster.avif?t=1767087475\" width=616 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/7430e1b568c9d535dda7745707de0fe7.webm?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/7430e1b568c9d535dda7745707de0fe7.mp4?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable characters. Each has its own mechanics and upgrade tree so you can enjoy multiple ways to play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ effects that can be applied in combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vision is limited for both you and your enemies. You can expand it using skills, items, or attacks, but enemies also have their own vision system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemy minions mid\u2011battle to collect essence and unlock exclusive upgrades. If you eliminate your own minions, you deny resources to your rival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine genetic and apocalyptic attacks, and counter with defenses specialized against each damage type.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 save\u2011file slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade love and chaos in every pixel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.poster.avif?t=1767087475\" width=606 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.webm?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1767087475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1767087475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767087475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767087475","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before humanity existed, Earth was ruled by the Existentials: colossal conscious beings capable of shaping reality. They created lesser races to serve them, but not all accepted that fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Some chose to rebel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bereshipsis</strong> is a turn-based tactical roguelike where you lead a team of rebellious Existentials determined to defy their creators and prevent the end of the world. Choose wisely, act strategically, and face a collapsing future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/5b38d1800d0609d67efad9da42c3ad9e.poster.avif?t=1767087475\" width=616 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3