li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 save\u2011file slots.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade love and chaos in every pixel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.poster.avif?t=1767087475\" width=606 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/4d88c1aac92262585a94714b93ed28eb.webm?t=1767087475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Vic"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/eacfd1cfeecd1efd8dc5b04650943d607a398aca/header.jpg?t=1767087475","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798630/446044967/e2079e9cfbc7435809dc46e1b535c4a70df92e1d/1750566441/dash_